WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:03.324
A woman was driving to work.

2
00:00:03.325 --> 00:00:06.412
She stopped at a red traffic light.

3
00:00:06.413 --> 00:00:09.424
She frowned as she waited for the light to change.

4
00:00:09.425 --> 00:00:13.378
"I'm going to be late for work," she thought.

5
00:00:13.379 --> 00:00:15.772
The light finally turned green.

6
00:00:15.773 --> 00:00:17.957
The woman started to go.

7
00:00:17.958 --> 00:00:20.527
Then a cow walked in front of her car.

8
00:00:20.528 --> 00:00:22.923
"Moo!"

9
00:00:22.924 --> 00:00:25.218
"Yikes!" the woman said.

10
00:00:25.219 --> 00:00:28.318
"What's that cow doing here?"

11
00:00:28.319 --> 00:00:32.201
The woman honked her horn, but the cow didn't move.

12
00:00:32.202 --> 00:00:36.505
She opened the car door and—"Ouch!"

13
00:00:36.506 --> 00:00:39.235
A chicken pecked at the woman's leg.

14
00:00:39.236 --> 00:00:42.836
The woman looked around and saw more farm animals in the road.

15
00:00:42.837 --> 00:00:46.343
People beeped their horns and got out of their cars.

16
00:00:46.344 --> 00:00:50.159
"Shoo!" A man tried to make some cows move.

17
00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:52.781
The cows just stared at him.

18
00:00:52.782 --> 00:00:55.290
The woman sighed and looked at her watch.

19
00:00:55.291 --> 00:00:59.536
"I'm going to be really late now," she thought.

20
00:00:59.537 --> 00:01:02.971
"Maybe I can take a different road to work."

21
00:01:02.972 --> 00:01:05.559
She got back into her car and drove away.

22
00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:10.390
She started to make a right turn onto another street.

23
00:01:10.391 --> 00:01:14.703
Suddenly stalks of corn sprang up in front of her car.

24
00:01:14.704 --> 00:01:16.713
"Huh?" she cried.

25
00:01:16.714 --> 00:01:23.835
The woman braked hard. Screech!

26
00:01:23.836 --> 00:01:26.007
*** Roxy and her friends were at the

27
00:01:26.008 --> 00:01:29.013
park. They were warming up before their softball game.

28
00:01:29.014 --> 00:01:32.216
Mara threw the ball to Terrell.

29
00:01:32.217 --> 00:01:35.264
"Nice catch, Terrell!"

30
00:01:35.265 --> 00:01:38.579
Terrell threw the ball to Roxy.

31
00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:40.967
"I hope I get a hit today."

32
00:01:40.968 --> 00:01:44.076
"I want to get a hit too," Jack said.

33
00:01:44.077 --> 00:01:46.030
Terrell glanced at Roxy.

34
00:01:46.031 --> 00:01:49.339
"Rocket Girl would get a home run every time."

35
00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:51.904
Roxy chuckled.

36
00:01:51.905 --> 00:01:55.226
"It wouldn't be fair if Rocket Girl played with us."

37
00:01:55.227 --> 00:02:00.327
Mara nodded. "Nobody could hit the ball farther than her!"

38
00:02:00.328 --> 00:02:02.486
Just then a whistle blew.

39
00:02:02.487 --> 00:02:06.390
"The game's about to start," Jack said.

40
00:02:06.391 --> 00:02:11.039
As the kids went toward the dugout, Roxy's watch beeped.

41
00:02:11.040 --> 00:02:15.267
"Um, I forgot my water bottle," she said.

42
00:02:15.268 --> 00:02:20.824
"I'll, er, be back soon."

43
00:02:20.825 --> 00:02:24.476
She hurried away and ducked behind some bushes.

44
00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:27.772
"What's wrong, Mayor Bloom?" Roxy said.

45
00:02:27.773 --> 00:02:32.688
"I'm getting some unusual reports, Rocket Girl," Mayor Bloom said.

46
00:02:32.689 --> 00:02:36.268
"And the situation is growing very serious."

47
00:02:36.269 --> 00:02:40.263
"Oh no! Is someone robbing True Savings Bank?

48
00:02:40.264 --> 00:02:45.553
Or is a giant blob eating up downtown?" Roxy asked.

49
00:02:45.554 --> 00:02:48.658
"No, nothing like that," Mayor Bloom said.

50
00:02:48.659 --> 00:02:52.085
"It's farm animals."

51
00:02:52.086 --> 00:02:55.268
"Farm animals?" Roxy said.

52
00:02:55.269 --> 00:03:00.435
"Yes. They're blocking traffic on West Street," Mayor Bloom said.

53
00:03:00.436 --> 00:03:02.773
"Nobody knows where they came from.

54
00:03:02.774 --> 00:03:05.955
But we need to clear the streets fast."

55
00:03:05.956 --> 00:03:08.828
"Don't worry, Mayor," Roxy said.

56
00:03:08.829 --> 00:03:12.762
"I'm on my way!"

